The Amiga theme's window decorator and control look, in the style of the Amiga's
Workbench 1.3 as Arthur Choung's HOTDOG draws it (https://github.com/paulwratt/HOTDOG,
a mirror of fmamp.com/hotdoglinux). The window gadgets' pixels and the palette come
from HOTDOG's objects/object-AmigaWindow.m, and how buttons, check boxes, radio
buttons, text fields and menus look from its other Amiga objects. HOTDOG is
Copyright (c) 2020 Arthur Choung, under the GNU General Public License, version 3
or later (LICENSE), and so are these add-ons.
